          "name": "Up and down",
          "source": "-- The lift rises 4 m and comes back down, again and again.\n-- Stand on it to ride along.\nlocal lift = script.object\nlocal bottom = lift.position\n\nwhile true do\n  lift:moveTo(bottom + vector(0, 0, 4), 3)\n  wait(5)\n  lift:moveTo(bottom, 3)\n  wait(5)\nend\n"
